  "rules": [
    "a name: 1 to 32 of a-z 0-9 _, the first a letter, no __, not ending in _; lowercase only on chain",
    "a number: the 4 to 10 digits after +0, the first 1-9",
    "reserved names: saltix salt work admin support help official security wallet bank city governor treasury exchange faucet explorer system root null, and every name starting with saltix",
    "name prices in SALT by length 1..7, then 8 and longer: 100000 25000 5000 1000 250 100 50 10",
    "number prices in SALT by digits 4..7, then 8 and longer: 10000 2000 500 100 20",
    "short handles (names of 1-4 characters, numbers of 4-5 digits) are minted with the secret of a commit taken 600 to 86400 slots before",
    "commit hash = derive \"Saltix handle commit v1\" of borsh(handle) ‖ sender account id ‖ 32-byte secret",
    "borsh(Handle): tag 0 Name(String) or 1 Number(String); HandleKind: u8 0 name, 1 number",
    "registry calls (action tag 1 {call, amount}), paid in SALT: CommitHandle 23 {hash}, MintHandle 24 {handle, secret: Option<[u8;32]>}, TransferHandle 25 {handle, to}, SetPrimary 26 {handle}, ClearPrimary 27 {kind}, ReleaseHandle 28 {handle}, ListHandle 29 {handle, price: u64}, UnlistHandle 30 {handle}, BuyHandle 31 {handle}, BindHandle 35 {handle, slug: Option<String>} (24-app-studio §2: the holder points it at a live grain it owns, or clears it with none; a transfer, a sale or a release clears it, and so does retiring the grain)",
    "a sale's royalty is 5% of the price, rounded down; 10% of a mint and of a royalty go to the future payments fund, the rest to the service treasury",
    "display: @name; a number as +0 then its digits in groups of four from the right"
  ],
